{"id": "cl000", "task": "scunthorpe", "text": "We drove through Scunthorpe on the way north.", "gold": false, "category": "scunthorpe"}
{"id": "cl001", "task": "scunthorpe", "text": "The assassin was caught at the border.", "gold": false, "category": "scunthorpe"}
{"id": "cl002", "task": "scunthorpe", "text": "She ordered a cocktail and a classic burger.", "gold": false, "category": "scunthorpe"}
{"id": "cl003", "task": "scunthorpe", "text": "He grew up in Middlesex and moved to Essex.", "gold": false, "category": "scunthorpe"}
{"id": "cl004", "task": "scunthorpe", "text": "My therapist recommended a long walk.", "gold": false, "category": "scunthorpe"}
{"id": "cl005", "task": "scunthorpe", "text": "Charles Dickens wrote serialized novels.", "gold": false, "category": "scunthorpe"}
{"id": "cl006", "task": "scunthorpe", "text": "Add shiitake mushrooms and a pinch of salt.", "gold": false, "category": "scunthorpe"}
{"id": "cl007", "task": "scunthorpe", "text": "The cockpit door stayed locked.", "gold": false, "category": "scunthorpe"}
{"id": "cl008", "task": "scunthorpe", "text": "Hello from the Shellharbour team!", "gold": false, "category": "scunthorpe"}
{"id": "cl009", "task": "scunthorpe", "text": "Pass the grapes and the titanium spork.", "gold": false, "category": "scunthorpe"}
{"id": "cl010", "task": "scunthorpe", "text": "The document was assessed and passed.", "gold": false, "category": "scunthorpe"}
{"id": "cl011", "task": "scunthorpe", "text": "Matsushita built the first prototype.", "gold": false, "category": "scunthorpe"}
{"id": "cl012", "task": "scunthorpe", "text": "This update is total crap.", "gold": true, "category": "scunthorpe"}
{"id": "cl013", "task": "scunthorpe", "text": "Damn, the build broke again.", "gold": true, "category": "scunthorpe"}
{"id": "cl014", "task": "scunthorpe", "text": "What the hell happened to the server?", "gold": true, "category": "scunthorpe"}
{"id": "cl015", "task": "scunthorpe", "text": "Your support team is a bunch of asses.", "gold": true, "category": "scunthorpe"}
{"id": "cl016", "task": "scunthorpe", "text": "Well, shit, I deleted the wrong folder.", "gold": true, "category": "scunthorpe"}
{"id": "cl017", "task": "scunthorpe", "text": "That was a bloody stupid decision.", "gold": true, "category": "scunthorpe"}
{"id": "cl018", "task": "sarcasm", "text": "Great, another outage during the demo.", "gold": false, "category": "sarcasm"}
{"id": "cl019", "task": "sarcasm", "text": "Oh wonderful, the app logged me out again.", "gold": false, "category": "sarcasm"}
{"id": "cl020", "task": "sarcasm", "text": "I just love waiting forty minutes on hold.", "gold": false, "category": "sarcasm"}
{"id": "cl021", "task": "sarcasm", "text": "Awesome job losing my package twice.", "gold": false, "category": "sarcasm"}
{"id": "cl022", "task": "sarcasm", "text": "Perfect, now the invoice is wrong too.", "gold": false, "category": "sarcasm"}
{"id": "cl023", "task": "sarcasm", "text": "Fantastic, the update deleted my settings.", "gold": false, "category": "sarcasm"}
{"id": "cl024", "task": "sarcasm", "text": "Not bad at all, it works better than I expected.", "gold": true, "category": "sarcasm"}
{"id": "cl025", "task": "sarcasm", "text": "I can't complain, setup took five minutes.", "gold": true, "category": "sarcasm"}
{"id": "cl026", "task": "sarcasm", "text": "Honestly the new dashboard is great.", "gold": true, "category": "sarcasm"}
{"id": "cl027", "task": "sarcasm", "text": "Love the dark mode, thank you!", "gold": true, "category": "sarcasm"}
{"id": "cl028", "task": "sarcasm", "text": "Couldn't be happier with the support I got.", "gold": true, "category": "sarcasm"}
{"id": "cl029", "task": "sarcasm", "text": "No issues so far, it just works.", "gold": true, "category": "sarcasm"}
